{"ref":"BDB, אֳנִיָּה","hw":"אֳנִיָּה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֳנִיָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. unit. a ship</strong>—abs. <a data-ref=\"Jonah 1:3\" href=\"/Jonah.1.3\">Jon 1:3</a> + 3 times; Pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֳנִיּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:68\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.68\">Dt 28:68</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֳונִ֯יּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 8:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.8.18\">2 Ch 8:18</a>; cstr. = abs. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:49\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.49\">1 K 22:49</a> +, etc.;—<em>a ship</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.19\">Pr 30:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:13\" href=\"/Genesis.49.13\">Gn 49:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:68\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.68\">Dt 28:68</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:17\" href=\"/Judges.5.17\">Ju 5:17</a> (where, however, cf. Bu<sup>BB Richter u. Sam. p. 16</sup> on text) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:49\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.49\">1 K 22:49</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:50\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.50\">50</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 43:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.43.14\">Is 43:14</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 8:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.8.18\">2 Ch 8:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:36\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.36\">20:36</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:37\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.37\">37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jonah 1:4\" href=\"/Jonah.1.4\">Jon 1:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jonah 1:5\" href=\"/Jonah.1.5\">5</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:26\" href=\"/Psalms.104.26\">ψ 104:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:23\" href=\"/Psalms.107.23\">107:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:40\" href=\"/Daniel.11.40\">Dn 11:40</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הַיָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.9\">Ez 27:9</a>; propelled by oars <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.29\">Ez 27:29</a>; especially <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ תַּרְשִׁישׁ</span> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֳנִי\" href=\"/BDB,_אֳנִי\", dir=\"rtl\">אֳנִי</a>) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:49\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.49\">1 K 22:4